B.NT=new A.hR("Spacing drill: 20 fed balls, setting up so contact is a full arm\u2019s reach plus racket from your body \u2014 no crowding.","Soft-arm drill: 20 fed balls at 70% pace, keeping a relaxed bend in the elbow at contact.")
B.NY=new A.hR("Stay-tall drill: 20 fed balls, pushing up out of your legs as you swing instead of sinking.","Wide-base drill: 20 fed balls from a stance a little wider than your shoulders, sitting into your legs before each swing.")
B.NV=new A.hR("Low-to-high drill: start the racket below the ball, finish over your opposite shoulder. 20 fed balls aiming 1 m over the net.","Through-the-ball drill: 20 fed balls driven deep at a target 2 m inside the baseline, swinging forward toward it.")
B.NX=new A.hR("Tray drill: carry the ball forward on the strings as if on a tray. 20 fed slices that stay low and land deep.","High-to-low drill: start the racket above the ball and finish forward and low. 20 fed slices.")
B.NS=new A.hR("\u201cOne-two\u201d drill: say \u201cone\u201d on the take-back and \u201ctwo\u201d on the swing. 20 fed balls at a steady rhythm.","Early-prep drill: turn and take the racket back the moment the ball leaves the feeder\u2019s hand. 20 fed balls.")
B.NR=new A.hR("Footwork drill: 20 fed balls, moving so every contact is between waist and chest \u2014 never down by your knees.","Back-up drill: 20 high fed balls, taking two quick steps back so each one drops to chest height before you hit.")
B.NQ=new A.hR("Cone drill: place a cone a step in front of your front foot and make contact level with it. 20 fed balls.","Let-it-come drill: 20 fed balls, making contact just ahead of your front hip instead of reaching for it.")
B.NW=new A.hR("Loose-and-fast drill: 10 quick, relaxed shadow swings, then 20 fed balls at 80% effort with a grip pressure of 3 out of 10.",null)
B.O_=new A.hR(null,"Slow-motion drill: 10 slow shadow swings along a fence line, then 20 fed balls at half pace keeping that same path.")
B.NZ=new A.hR(null,"Watch-the-contact drill: 20 fed balls, keeping your eyes on the contact spot for a beat after the ball has gone.")
B.NU=new A.hR("Hold-the-finish drill: 20 fed balls, freezing for two seconds with the racket over your opposite shoulder.","Extend-to-target drill: 20 fed balls, reaching the racket toward your target before letting it finish.")
B.Wm=new A.bI(B.Xu,[B.NT,B.NY,B.NV,B.NX,B.NS,B.NR,B.NQ,B.NW,B.O_,B.NZ,B.NU],A.ai("bI<l,hR>"))
